                            "text": "<p>I'm a {{Python Django}} developer with a passion for building [[secure and scalable backend systems]]. I hold a B.Sc. in Information Technology and have hands-on experience developing enterprise-grade authentication systems.</p><p>My expertise includes JWT authentication, role-based access control, multi-database architectures, and async task processing with Celery. I enjoy solving complex problems and implementing security best practices in production environments.</p><p>I look forward to collaborating [[with you!]]</p>"
